### Mind Platform — multi-agent viz sample requests
### Open this file in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension installed, then click "Send Request" above each block.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ── Home page: general inquiry ───────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/inquiry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "find recent service requests where status is new",
  "scope": {
    "userId": "u_demo",
    "tenantId": "t_mind_qatar",
    "allowedBlueprintIds": ["bp_municipal_operations", "bp_urban_planning"]
  }
}

### ── Report page: deep analysis ────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/report
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "analyze service request volume by municipality over the last 90 days and surface key trends",
  "blueprintId": "bp_municipal_operations",
  "scope": {
    "userId": "u_demo",
    "tenantId": "t_mind_qatar",
    "allowedBlueprintIds": ["bp_municipal_operations", "bp_urban_planning"]
  }
}

